# GraphRank

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphRank } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphRank
  title="example"
  max={0}
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `items` | `RankItem[]` | `—` | — |
| `max?` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `ticks?` | `number` | `20` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `RankItem`
- `GraphRankProps`
